      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我家的仙子伊布小可爱呀，\n能从触角放出缓和情绪的波动。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BB676844ED95B504F0A5E035C0F53EF72315440FF0C000A80FD4ECE89E689D2653E51FA7F13548C60C57EEA76846CE252A8300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说，它能通过\n传送波动来平息争执。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
