    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么回事！？\n居然没有任何人在争执！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 97,
      "offsetInSection": 4908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E4856DE4E8BFF01FF1F000A5C4571366CA167094EFB4F554EBA57284E896267FF0100100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我家仙子伊布也因为\n无法发挥能力而很烦躁。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 98,
      "offsetInSection": 4956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BB64ED95B504F0A5E034E5F56E04E3A000A65E06CD553D1632580FD529B800C5F8870E68E81300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仙咿……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 99,
      "offsetInSection": 5008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED954BF20262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仙子伊布你也太没出息了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就算没有争执，\n你也应该强行用爱的力量<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n更多、更多地缓和别人的情绪！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 100,
      "offsetInSection": 5020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED95B504F0A5E034F604E5F592A6CA151FA606F4E86FF0100100001BE01000A5C317B976CA167094E896267FF0C000A4F604E5F5E948BE55F3A884C752872317684529B91CF00100001BE00000A66F4591A300166F4591A57307F13548C522B4EBA768460C57EEAFF0100100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仙咿……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 101,
      "offsetInSection": 5136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED954BF20262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要争执了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 102,
      "offsetInSection": 5148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D89814E8962674E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "缓和情绪吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 103,
      "offsetInSection": 5160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7F13548C60C57EEA54270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算事情不顺利，\n我也不该迁怒于仙子伊布……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 104,
      "offsetInSection": 5172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B974E8B60C54E0D987A5229FF0C000A62114E5F4E0D8BE58FC160124E8E4ED95B504F0A5E032026202600100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对不起啊，仙子伊布，\n我打心底向你道歉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 105,
      "offsetInSection": 5228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E0D8D77554AFF0C4ED95B504F0A5E03FF0C000A621162535FC35E9554114F6090536B49300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "仙咿♡",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 106,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED954BF26610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也谢谢你哦！\n想让仙子伊布成为伙伴的话……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 107,
      "offsetInSection": 5288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8C228C224F6054E6FF01000A60F38BA94ED95B504F0A5E0362104E3A4F194F3476848BDD2026202600100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让伊布学会妖精属性的招式\n是很重要的哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 108,
      "offsetInSection": 5340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA94F0A5E035B664F1A59967CBE5C5E6027768462DB5F0F000A662F5F8891CD8981768454E6300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要不断地倾注爱意，\n总有一天会有仙子伊布像这孩子一样，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也为你带来疗愈哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 109,
      "offsetInSection": 5392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89814E0D65AD5730503E6CE87231610FFF0C000A603B67094E0059294F1A67094ED95B504F0A5E0350CF8FD95B695B504E006837FF0C00100001BE00000A4E5F4E3A4F605E2667657597610854E6300200100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来吧，仙子伊布小可爱，\n今后也继续传递爱意吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 110,
      "offsetInSection": 5484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655427FF0C4ED95B504F0A5E035C0F53EF7231FF0C000A4ECA540E4E5F7EE77EED4F2090127231610F5427FF0100100002011401400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿o",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 111,
